The owner has described the compass construction in at least eight vignettes (2026-10-23) and again on 2026-10-28, and says it has been recorded in error repeatedly (vignette 9a255ae4). Derived records restated it instead of citing it, and the errors repeated:
- srs-context cc05d4c9 mapped the compass onto T3 axis names and swapped lines 1 and 3;
- on 2026-10-28 an agent called a fractal domain's axes the compass, then stated a trigram-line reading as fact (b326b3fb, srs-context#90).
